msgid "litem.frameTop.hint"
msgstr "----HINT----\n1. After importing, click “Basic Analysis” manually.\n2. First click on “Basic Analysis” will auto-open import window.\n3. Do not disable ‘Render’ in Settings unless necessary. Disable 3D rendering for low-end systems.\n4. Block IDs and replacement table can use either Chinese or game ID (e.g. 泥土 & minecraft:dirt)\n5. Replacement format: oldBlock-newBlock, oldBlock2-newBlock2,...\n\t‘-’ separates old/new blocks, ‘,’ separates groups. You can mix Chinese and IDs.\n\tAdd block properties after old block (for editing) or after new block (for output).\n\tAll properties must be wrapped in braces {} and use key-value pairs like {\"property\":\"value\",...}. All strings must be in quotes!\nExample: Furnace{\"facing\":\"west\"}-BlastFurnace{\"facing\":\"east\"}, OakSlab-OakSlab{\"waterlogged\":\"false\"}\nFurnaces facing west → Blast furnaces facing east; All Oak slabs → non-waterlogged Oak slabs"

